  "description": "The STEVENS Camino RS is a high-end race gravel bike developed from scratch for competitive use. Based on the geometry of the successful and award-winning Camino series, the frame combines gravel-specific features with design elements from our road bikes that blend in harmoniously. The tapered head tube has an aerodynamic shape, while the fork, down tube and seat stays are based on the characteristic design of the Arcalis Aero road bike with their tear-off edges. The sloping top tube is inspired by the STEVENS Xenith endurance bike and, in addition to a lower standover height, ensures seating comfort on long gravel rides. The frame and fork offer a maximum tyre clearance of 45 millimetres for those looking for the optimal mix of rolling resistance, comfort and weight.",
